    <item>
      <title>HashiCorp</title>
      <link>/docs/dev/hashicorp/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>/docs/dev/hashicorp/</guid>
      <description>
        
        
        &lt;p&gt;HashiCorp is a technology company specializing in infrastructure automation for cloud environments. Their suite of open-source tools, such as Terraform, Vault, Consul, and Packer, enables organizations to provision, secure, connect, and run infrastructure efficiently. HashiCorp&amp;rsquo;s solutions support multi-cloud and hybrid cloud strategies, helping teams manage infrastructure as code and automate workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://imageio.forbes.com/specials-images/imageserve/653ad2e3ead3e46e41269878/Image-showing-HashiCorp-s-portfolio-/960x0.png?format=png&amp;amp;width=960&#34; alt=&#34;HashiCorp Shows That Its Far More Than Just Terraform&#34;  loading=&#34;lazy&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

      </description>
    </item>
    
